# DATABASE_URL is injected by Dockhold when you enable the managed database
# add-on. The managed database ships with pgvector enabled, so vector columns
# and similarity search work out of the box. (VECTOR_STORE_URL points at the same
# database, if a tool expects that name.)
#
# PORT is provided by Dockhold at runtime.
#
# For local dev, point at a Postgres with pgvector, e.g.:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/postgres
